- Report fees, signed funding, slippage attribution, gross-positive/net-negative cohorts with source references and honest data coverage.
- Observed-position MFE/MAE from eligible candles within actual historical holding interval, with realistic same-candle ambiguity handling.
- Separate pre-entry forecast features from ex-post observations; event/known-at cutoffs prevent look-ahead. No fabricated intrabar sequence, hypothetical fills, or execution improvements.
