- P-3 rejected-signal SHADOW replay remains **PROHIBITED**. Never simulate forbidden skipped or risk-rejected signals as executed trades. Mark conclusions requiring it `NOT_EVALUATED`. In this contract, Gate 6 paper-challenger shadow is a distinct forward paper observation stream; it never authorizes P-3 replay or synthesizing forward outcomes from rejected signals.
